{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 22,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then answered Eliphaz the Temanite, and said,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Can a man be profitable unto God?\nSurely he that is wise is profitable unto himself.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Is it any pleasure to the Almighty, that thou art righteous?\nOr is it gain ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", that thou makest thy ways perfect?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Is it for thy fear ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " that he reproveth thee,\nThat he entereth with thee into judgment?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Is not thy wickedness great?\nNeither is there any end to thine iniquities.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thou hast taken pledges of thy brother for nought,\nAnd stripped the naked of their clothing.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou hast not given water to the weary to drink,\nAnd thou hast withholden bread from the hungry.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But as for the mighty man, he had the earth;\nAnd the honorable man, he dwelt in it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou hast sent widows away empty,\nAnd the arms of the fatherless have been broken.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore snares are round about thee,\nAnd sudden fear troubleth thee,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Or darkness, so that thou canst not see,\nAnd abundance of waters cover thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Is not God in the height of heaven?\nAnd behold the height of the stars, how high they are!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And thou sayest, What doth God know?\nCan he judge through the thick darkness?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thick clouds are a covering to him, so that he seeth not;\nAnd he walketh on the vault of heaven.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wilt thou keep the old way\nWhich wicked men have trodden?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who were snatched away before their time,\nWhose foundation was poured out as a stream,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who said unto God, Depart from us;\nAnd, What can the Almighty do for us?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yet he filled their houses with good things:\nBut the counsel of the wicked is far from me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous see it, and are glad;\nAnd the innocent laugh them to scorn,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Saying",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", Surely they that did rise up against us are cut off,\nAnd the remnant of them the fire hath consumed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Acquaint now thyself with him, and be at peace:Thereby good shall come unto thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Receive, I pray thee, the law from his mouth,\nAnd lay up his words in thy heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If thou return to the Almighty, thou shalt be built up,If thou put away unrighteousness far from thy tents.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And lay thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thy",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " treasure in the dust,\nAnd ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the gold of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Ophir among the stones of the brooks;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the Almighty will be thy treasure,\nAnd precious silver unto thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For then shalt thou delight thyself in the Almighty,\nAnd shalt lift up thy face unto God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt make thy prayer unto him, and he will hear thee;\nAnd thou shalt pay thy vows.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt also decree a thing, and it shall be established unto thee;\nAnd light shall shine upon thy ways.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When they cast ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thee",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " down, thou shalt say, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "There is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lifting up;\nAnd the humble person he will save.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.22.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.22.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He will deliver ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " him that is not innocent:\nYea, he shall be delivered through the cleanness of thy hands.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
